# URL RepChecker

A Python-based cybersecurity tool that analyzes URLs and provides basic reputation and security information through a modern desktop GUI built with CustomTkinter.

## Overview

URL RepChecker is designed to help users quickly inspect URLs and identify potential security concerns. The application extracts URL information and will eventually provide risk scoring, phishing indicators, and reputation analysis.

This project is being developed incrementally to demonstrate secure software development practices, GUI development, and cybersecurity-focused analysis techniques.

## Features

### Current Features
- Modern CustomTkinter GUI
- URL input and analysis
- Domain extraction
- HTTPS detection
- Modular project structure

### Planned Features
- URL risk scoring
- Phishing keyword detection
- Suspicious domain indicators
- IP address URL detection
- URL length analysis
- Domain age lookup
- Reputation findings
- Exportable reports
- Enhanced GUI dashboard
- Executable packaging with PyInstaller

