## Installation

### Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/eristenn/URL-RepChecker.git
cd URL-RepChecker
```

### Create Virtual Environment

```bash
python -m venv venv
```

### Activate Virtual Environment

Windows:

```bash
venv\Scripts\activate
```

### Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## Running the Application

```bash
python main.py
```

